  ($q$family-dlg$q$, $q$family$q$, 10, $q$Catching up on family$q$, $j${"kind":"dialogue","scene":"Two old friends catching up about marriage and family.","lines":[{"speaker":"A","thai":"คุณแต่งงานรึยัง","roman":"khun tɛ̀ng-ngaan rɯ́-yang","english":"Are you married yet?"},{"speaker":"B","thai":"ยังไม่ได้แต่งงานยังโสด","roman":"yang mâi dâi tɛ̀ng-ngaan, yang sòot","english":"Not married yet, still single."},{"speaker":"A","thai":"คุณมีพี่น้องกี่คน","roman":"khun mii phîi-nɔ́ɔng gìi kon","english":"How many siblings do you have?"},{"speaker":"B","thai":"มีพี่ชายคนหนึ่งกับน้องสาวสองคน","roman":"mii phîi-chaai kon nɯ̀ng gàp nɔ́ɔng-sǎao sɔ̌ɔng kon","english":"I have one older brother and two younger sisters."},{"speaker":"A","thai":"พ่อแม่อยู่ที่ไหน","roman":"phɔ̂ɔ-mɛ̂ɛ yùu thîi-nǎi","english":"Where are your parents?"},{"speaker":"B","thai":"อยู่บ้าน","roman":"yùu bâan","english":"At home."}],"steps":[{"type":"intro"},{"type":"comprehension","lineIndex":1,"options":[{"text":"Not married yet, still single.","correct":true},{"text":"How many siblings do you have?","correct":false},{"text":"Where are your parents?","correct":false},{"text":"I have a family.","correct":false}]},{"type":"comprehension","lineIndex":3,"options":[{"text":"I have one older brother and two younger sisters.","correct":true},{"text":"How many siblings do you have?","correct":false},{"text":"Not married yet, still single.","correct":false},{"text":"At home.","correct":false}]},{"type":"translate","lineIndex":0,"options":[{"text":"Are you married yet?","correct":true},{"text":"How many siblings do you have?","correct":false},{"text":"Where are your parents?","correct":false},{"text":"At home.","correct":false}]},{"type":"translate","lineIndex":4,"options":[{"text":"Where are your parents?","correct":true},{"text":"Are you married yet?","correct":false},{"text":"I have one older brother and two younger sisters.","correct":false},{"text":"At home.","correct":false}]},{"type":"blank","lineIndex":2,"bef